<title>JAPAN: Jidosha Kiki -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Jidosha Kiki -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 34.15		vs	   36.74</p>
<p> Operating	  452    million	  vs	  962    million</p>
<p> Current	    518    million	  vs	  705    million</p>
<p> Net		  316    million	  vs	  518    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.75 yen	  vs	    7.78 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     67 million	  vs	  67 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Jidosha Kiki Co Ltd is the largest domestic maker of power brakes.</p>
</text>
